# The vectors a reader fails when this rule is deleted, and no others:
# a double read refuses NaN and the infinities.
#
# CMakeLists.txt builds that reader, and ctest requires its failures to be
# exactly this list. A vector added to the corpus that pins the rule belongs here.

double-refuse-positive-infinity
double-refuse-negative-infinity
double-refuse-quiet-nan
double-refuse-negative-quiet-nan
double-refuse-signaling-nan
double-refuse-nan-with-payload
double-refuse-negative-nan-all-payload-bits
double-refuse-nan-payload-in-low-group-only
